  <section class="section">
    <h2>An honest history</h2>
    <article class="prose">
      <p>
        The house was built in 1847 on a plantation-era farm. The Desha and Searcy families were
        slaveowners, and the land around the house was worked by enslaved people.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>

